# 🌿 FloraSense – AI-Powered Smart Garden System

FloraSense is a smart gardening system that leverages IoT sensors and AI to monitor and optimize plant health. By collecting real-time environmental data, the system provides insights and recommendations to help users take better care of their plants.

## 🛠 Project Overview

- **IoT Sensors**: Collect data on soil moisture, temperature, humidity, and light levels.
- **AI Analysis**: Predict plant health and provide care recommendations.
- **Web Dashboard**: Visualize real-time and historical data.
- **MQTT Communication**: Efficient and reliable IoT connectivity.

## 🚀 Development Roadmap

This project is in its early stages. Future milestones include:

- Setting up the backend and database.
- Implementing MQTT for real-time sensor data.
- Developing the AI model for plant health prediction.
- Building the frontend dashboard.

Stay tuned for updates! 🌱
